    2118553369,
    857677181
   ],
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
   "text": "Well, folks, in another exciting development from tech visionary and definitely-not-a-psychopath Belon Fusk, he’s unveiled his latest groundbreaking initiative—turning people into food!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
