        "value": 6
       }
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "-1704793414": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1127923837,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "We’re seeing a spike in all the usual fun activities—unmarked cargo, shifty-eyed men in trench coats, and a dramatic increase in sex workers who, let’s be honest, probably have better healthcare than most of us.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1920398614": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1621869749,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Now, before you overreact, let’s remember—Fusk has always been ahead of the curve. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "694785351": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -915811141,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "No cryptic selfies. No poetic midnight rants. Not even a single ‘Gaze into the abyss, my loves’ post in over 48 hours!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1747372985": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 181385099,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Eyewitnesses report that her perfectly radiant skin was so blindingly divine, a few unfortunate peasants ran headfirst into the ocean!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1843089295": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1723904990,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Ohhh, Veronica! Sweetie, darling, starlight of our lives, what happened? Was your oat milk latte one degree too cold? Did someone have the AUDACITY to breathe in your presence?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1155760527": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1723904990,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
   "text": "Such tragedy. Such betrayal. How will we ever recover from this heinous act of rebellion?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-95351522": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 181385099,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
   "text": "Folks, let’s take a moment of silence for those poor souls… and then let’s get them some sunglasses because Celeste isn’t dimming her shine for anyone!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-219230664": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 501514350,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "That’s right, folks. Peak News is great, but Peak Me? Even better. Exclusive content, behind-the-scenes chaos, and maybe, just maybe… a few tasteful disasters.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2111662183": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 501514350,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
   "text": "So, for those who can’t get enough of me here—get ready. And for my haters? Well, congratulations! Now you get even more Claudia to complain about.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-264625326": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -915811141,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
   "text": "Has she ascended to the shadow realm? Did she summon something she shouldn’t have?  More as this story develops.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-588183515": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 740220104,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Witnesses report that this criminal mastermind has been toppling trash cans, stealing entire rotisserie chickens, and sitting wherever he pleases—blocking roads, businesses, and even city hall!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1924481042": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 740220104,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
   "text": "Authorities have attempted bribes of tuna, belly rubs, and even a gold-plated scratching post—but the beast remains uncontrollable. If you see it… do not engage. Just offer tribute and pray.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "857677181": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1621869749,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And, really, can we blame him? People are expensive, loud, and frankly, a little inefficient. Maybe it’s time we start giving back… in the most tastyway possible.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1916138561": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1127923837,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
   "text": "Who are they? What do they want? Will they accept bribes in the form of baked goods? We don’t know! But one thing’s for sure—Peak City’s harbor is no longer just for fishy business… it’s for business business.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1824310066": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "This has been Peak News with Claudia—thanks for watching!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2118553369": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1621869749,
   "actor": "Claudia",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "talk",
